UnitRelaySoulbound
├── given a soulbound deployment
│   └── it should deploy both satellites non-transferable
├── when transferring the soulbound yield token
│   └── it should revert with TokenNotTransferable
├── when transferring the soulbound principal token
│   └── it should revert with TokenNotTransferable
├── when permitting the soulbound yield token
│   └── it should revert with TokenNotTransferable
├── when permitting the soulbound principal token
│   ├── it should revert with TokenNotTransferable
│   ├── it should leave the shared nonce untouched
│   └── it should leave a delegation signed at that nonce spendable
├── when permitting a transferable yield token
│   └── it should set the allowance
└── when running the lifecycle soulbound
    └── it should admit, accrue, claim and exit without transfers
